@startuml agentic-offering-product-boundary
title Agentic Offering / Agentic Product Boundary ; per ADR-ES-018 §3

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Offering" as O
class "Product" as P
class "Agentic Product" as AP
class "Agentic Offering" as AO

O --> P : may comprise / include
P <|-- AP : specializes

O <|-- AO : specializes

note right
  Per ADR-ES-018 §3 + AOFF-NEG-002 + AOFF-NEG-014:
  - Agentic Offering is NOT Agentic Product
  - Agentic Product does NOT automatically make the whole Offering agentic
end note

@enduml
